Run `verify.sh` or inspect deployment volumes:
```bash
kubectl get deployment log-processor -o jsonpath='{.spec.template.spec.volumes}'
```
Expected Output:
`hostPath` volume is removed and replaced with `emptyDir` (or PVC), and the deployment is `1/1 READY`.
`verify.sh` exits with return code `0`.
